WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.735 --> 00:00:04.240
- This is the President Wilson
Hotel in Geneva, Switzerland,

00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:05.760
and outside of it, dozens

00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:09.120
of Swiss policemen are getting
ready to arrest someone,

00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:10.400
but the person they are about

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:13.920
to put in handcuffs is
not your typical tourist.

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:15.520
Instead, he's the son of one

00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:18.800
of the most notorious
dictators in the world.

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:23.360
The police is about to arrest
the son of Muammar Gaddafi.

00:00:23.360 --> 00:00:26.400
For over 40 years, the
Libyan ruler terrifies

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:28.000
and torments the world.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:29.760
The vast majority of the wealth

00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:32.960
of the country was siphoned
away into the pockets

00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:34.560
of the Gaddafi regime.

00:00:34.560 --> 00:00:39.520
His sons, this mad dog of
the Middle East has a a

00:00:39.520 --> 00:00:42.800
goal of a world revolution.

00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:45.360
And even though the policemen
know this isn't an ordinary

00:00:45.360 --> 00:00:48.800
arrest, there is no way they
can predict the insane chain

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:52.320
of events that will be set
off by this causing a conflict

00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:54.480
that would lead to economic warfare,

00:00:54.480 --> 00:00:57.040
travel bans a hostage crisis,

00:00:57.040 --> 00:01:00.880
and ultimately Gaddafi trying
to dissolve Switzerland

00:01:00.880 --> 00:01:04.960
and divide it up among
its neighboring countries.

00:01:04.960 --> 00:01:10.160
This is the story of
Gaddafi versus Switzerland.

00:01:11.360 --> 00:01:13.360
Let's back up for a moment to understand

00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:15.360
how we even got here.

00:01:15.360 --> 00:01:18.960
It all started with a phone
call to the Swiss police in July

00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:21.520
of 2008.

00:01:21.520 --> 00:01:24.880
The call comes from a maid
working at the President Wilson

00:01:24.880 --> 00:01:28.160
Hotel, located right on
the shores of Lake Geneva.

00:01:28.160 --> 00:01:31.520
It is one of the most
luxurious hotels in the world.

00:01:31.520 --> 00:01:34.880
It's Royal Penthouse Suite
is even considered the most

00:01:34.880 --> 00:01:37.760
expensive hotel room on the planet, and

00:01:37.760 --> 00:01:41.040
because of its location near
the United Nations building,

00:01:41.040 --> 00:01:43.840
this hotel often hosts
international diplomats

00:01:43.840 --> 00:01:46.240
and heads of state.

00:01:46.240 --> 00:01:48.480
The maid tells the police that she called

00:01:48.480 --> 00:01:50.960
because someone in distress approached her in the

00:01:50.960 --> 00:01:52.720
hotel hallway.

00:01:52.720 --> 00:01:56.960
This real hotel surveillance
footage shows that moment

00:01:56.960 --> 00:01:59.920
the woman in distress
claims that she is working

00:01:59.920 --> 00:02:02.880
for some very special hotel guests.

00:02:02.880 --> 00:02:07.760
Hannibal Gaddafi and his
wife, Aline Skaf, the son

00:02:07.760 --> 00:02:11.440
and daughter-in-law of Mummar
Gaddafi, who has ruled Libya

00:02:11.440 --> 00:02:13.040
for nearly 40 years

00:02:13.040 --> 00:02:17.600
At this point. Gaddafi is
a brutal dictator known

00:02:17.600 --> 00:02:19.360
for crushing descent at home

00:02:19.360 --> 00:02:22.000
and treating Libya like
his personal empire

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:26.080
and his children frequently
live it up in Europe.

00:02:26.080 --> 00:02:28.560
Aline is currently eight months pregnant

00:02:28.560 --> 00:02:31.200
and a couple had traveled
to Geneva in anticipation

00:02:31.200 --> 00:02:33.600
of the birth of their
child, bringing along

00:02:33.600 --> 00:02:37.600
with them many servants
to tend to their needs

00:02:37.600 --> 00:02:38.720
with all the servants

00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:41.440
and bodyguards, the Gaddafi's
had booked out a total

00:02:41.440 --> 00:02:44.160
of 10 rooms at the hotel.

00:02:44.800 --> 00:02:47.600
The surveillance footage
shows the corridor leading

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:50.800
to these rooms where a
makeshift table has been set up

00:02:50.800 --> 00:02:52.400
with Libyan guards ensuring

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:54.960
that no unauthorized people can get access

00:02:54.960 --> 00:02:56.880
to the dictator's son.

00:02:56.880 --> 00:02:59.920
The woman asking for help
describes to the hotel mate

00:02:59.920 --> 00:03:02.160
that she as well as one other employee

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:04.800
of the Gaddafi's have been brutally beaten

00:03:04.800 --> 00:03:06.880
by the Gaddafi couple.

00:03:07.600 --> 00:03:10.480
So after receiving the
phone call from the maid,

00:03:10.480 --> 00:03:12.080
Swiss police enter the hotel

00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:13.840
and they talk to the two employees

00:03:13.840 --> 00:03:15.840
that claim to have been beaten.

00:03:15.840 --> 00:03:18.480
They then take them both to the station

00:03:18.480 --> 00:03:21.840
and there the full extent
of the abuse becomes clear.

00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:25.520
As their many injuries are documented,

00:03:25.520 --> 00:03:28.480
the two servants had
clearly been severely abused

00:03:28.480 --> 00:03:31.120
and they feared that they
might even get killed once the

00:03:31.120 --> 00:03:33.120
couple returns with them to Libya.

00:03:33.120 --> 00:03:34.640
And so based on his evidence,

00:03:34.640 --> 00:03:36.160
the Swiss police make the decision

00:03:36.160 --> 00:03:39.600
to arrest Hannibal and Alene.

00:03:39.600 --> 00:03:42.560
But this will not just be a simple arrest.

00:03:42.560 --> 00:03:46.160
The police try to negotiate
with a delegate of the Gaddafi's

00:03:46.160 --> 00:03:47.280
to convince Hannibal

00:03:47.280 --> 00:03:50.640
and Alene to come to the
police station voluntarily.

00:03:50.640 --> 00:03:52.880
But this doesn't work.

00:03:52.880 --> 00:03:56.800
And after hours of talks, the
Geneva police decide it's time

00:03:56.800 --> 00:03:59.600
for action leading to this
scene from the beginning

00:03:59.600 --> 00:04:02.560
of the video with Swiss
police officers ready

00:04:02.560 --> 00:04:07.440
to enter the hotel soon two
dozen police officers make it

00:04:07.440 --> 00:04:10.080
to the floor with the Gaddafi suite,

00:04:10.080 --> 00:04:12.320
but here they hit a problem.

00:04:12.320 --> 00:04:15.280
Several bodyguards are
stationed outside the door

00:04:15.280 --> 00:04:19.440
and they are determined to
prevent the police from entering.

00:04:19.440 --> 00:04:21.600
The police. Officers try to argue

00:04:21.600 --> 00:04:24.800
and convince the Libyan
bodyguards to give up,

00:04:24.800 --> 00:04:28.560
but the bodyguards are
not willing to cooperate.

00:04:28.560 --> 00:04:31.120
And so a clash breaks out

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:34.800
with police officers actively
fighting the bodyguards

00:04:34.800 --> 00:04:38.240
of the Libyan ruling family.

00:04:38.240 --> 00:04:40.880
After several tense moments of resistance,

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:43.280
the bodyguards are finally restrained

00:04:43.280 --> 00:04:46.080
and two of them are arrested.

00:04:46.080 --> 00:04:50.080
Finally, the way is now clear
to enter the Gaddafi suite

00:04:50.080 --> 00:04:52.640
and Hannibal and Elene now surrender

00:04:52.640 --> 00:04:57.360
and allow themselves to
be taken into custody.

00:04:57.360 --> 00:04:59.760
They are discreetly
taken outta the back door

00:04:59.760 --> 00:05:02.400
and drive away in unmarked cars in order

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:04.640
to protect their privacy.

00:05:04.640 --> 00:05:07.280
Hannibal is taken to
the police station and

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:10.320
because Elene is so far
along in her pregnancy,

00:05:10.320 --> 00:05:12.640
she is taken to a hospital.

00:05:12.640 --> 00:05:15.280
It is a very delicate situation.

00:05:15.280 --> 00:05:17.120
Normally visiting dignitaries

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:20.080
of foreign nations would
have diplomatic immunity

00:05:20.080 --> 00:05:22.000
and they cannot be arrested.

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:25.200
But this doesn't apply if
the charges are criminal

00:05:25.200 --> 00:05:27.680
and outside of the scope
of political interest,

00:05:27.680 --> 00:05:30.080
like in this case with assault.

00:05:30.080 --> 00:05:32.960
And besides being the
son of the Libyan leader,

00:05:32.960 --> 00:05:35.760
Hannibal did not have diplomatic status in

00:05:35.760 --> 00:05:37.280
Switzerland at the time.

00:05:37.280 --> 00:05:40.080
And so Swiss officials
decide to move forward

00:05:40.080 --> 00:05:42.240
with the assault charges.

00:05:42.240 --> 00:05:45.440
Hannibal is treated just
as any other person charged

00:05:45.440 --> 00:05:47.840
with a crime and once brought to jail,

00:05:47.840 --> 00:05:50.400
he has his mugshot taken

00:05:50.400 --> 00:05:52.400
while the couple is held for two days.

00:05:52.400 --> 00:05:54.720
Their attorney is working for any solution

00:05:54.720 --> 00:05:56.160
to try to get them out.

00:05:56.160 --> 00:05:57.520
He tries arguing the courts

00:05:57.520 --> 00:06:00.880
that the couple should at
least be allowed out on bail

00:06:00.880 --> 00:06:04.720
and promises that the
Gaddafi's pose no flight risk

00:06:04.720 --> 00:06:07.120
and surprisingly it works.

00:06:07.120 --> 00:06:09.120
The couple is released on bail

00:06:09.120 --> 00:06:11.760
for roughly half a million dollars.

00:06:11.760 --> 00:06:13.760
It is an absurdly high amount,

00:06:13.760 --> 00:06:16.560
but for the very wealthy Gaddafi family,

00:06:16.560 --> 00:06:19.120
it is obviously not a problem.

00:06:19.120 --> 00:06:22.400
Hannibal and Elene walk free out on bail,

00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:24.400
and I don't really see how
this comes to a surprise

00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:26.560
to anyone, but their first stop is

00:06:26.560 --> 00:06:29.920
immediately to the airport.

00:06:29.920 --> 00:06:32.480
Their bail has no travel restrictions,

00:06:32.480 --> 00:06:34.640
and so the couple bought the first flight

00:06:34.640 --> 00:06:36.160
straight back to Libya.

00:06:36.160 --> 00:06:40.480
They have successfully
evaded prosecution once home.

00:06:40.480 --> 00:06:43.440
The Gaddafi's reach an
undisclosed financial settlement

00:06:43.440 --> 00:06:45.760
with the two servants who then agreed

00:06:45.760 --> 00:06:50.080
to drop all charges against
Hannibal and a lien.

00:06:50.080 --> 00:06:52.560
Now, normally you would think
that this would be the end

00:06:52.560 --> 00:06:55.840
of the story, a bizarre
international incident in which the

00:06:55.840 --> 00:06:58.720
Gaddafi's of course got away with it.

00:06:58.720 --> 00:07:01.280
But actually this is just a beginning

00:07:01.280 --> 00:07:07.040
because this incident has
made someone else really mad.

00:07:07.040 --> 00:07:10.960
Muammar Gaddafi is outraged
once he hears about the

00:07:10.960 --> 00:07:12.720
situation, especially

00:07:12.720 --> 00:07:16.000
because Haal claims that he
was mistreated by the police

00:07:16.000 --> 00:07:19.440
during the arrest, including
at one point having a bag

00:07:19.440 --> 00:07:20.800
placed over his head.

00:07:20.800 --> 00:07:24.000
And the Libyan leader now wants revenge.

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:27.520
Gaddafi demands to know the
names of the arresting officers,

00:07:27.520 --> 00:07:30.960
but Swiss authorities deny his request,

00:07:30.960 --> 00:07:34.240
and so he decides on a
scorched earth policy

00:07:34.240 --> 00:07:38.400
with Switzerland severing any
ties until he gets those names

00:07:38.400 --> 00:07:42.480
and an apology to his son.

00:07:42.480 --> 00:07:46.480
He prohibits Swiss companies
from doing business in Libya

00:07:46.480 --> 00:07:50.400
and closes offices of
several large companies.

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:53.600
He also cancels international flights.

00:07:53.600 --> 00:07:56.240
Back then, Swiss International
Airlines used to fly

00:07:56.240 --> 00:07:59.360
to Libya's Capital Tripoli
three times a week.

00:07:59.360 --> 00:08:02.880
But on Gaddafi's order, those
flights are first reduced

00:08:02.880 --> 00:08:07.120
to just one per week and
then completely prohibited.

00:08:07.120 --> 00:08:11.680
And in an unprecedented move,
Libya a major supplier of oil

00:08:11.680 --> 00:08:13.600
to many European countries,

00:08:13.600 --> 00:08:17.760
completely cuts off crude
oil exports to Switzerland.

00:08:17.760 --> 00:08:21.280
At the time, Libya
accounted for roughly 30%

00:08:21.280 --> 00:08:26.000
of all Swiss oil imports, 2
million metric tons a year,

00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:30.800
which Switzerland now has to
substitute from other places.

00:08:30.800 --> 00:08:33.280
Gaddafi is clearly trying
to do whatever he can

00:08:33.280 --> 00:08:34.960
to hurt Switzerland.

00:08:34.960 --> 00:08:38.480
At one point he even withdraws
5 billion US dollars in

00:08:38.480 --> 00:08:42.400
assets from his Swiss
bank accounts, $5 billion.

00:08:42.400 --> 00:08:45.040
Just for context, the
entire GDP of Libya in

00:08:45.040 --> 00:08:48.320
that same year was 60 billion,

00:08:48.320 --> 00:08:55.120
and it is now when Gaddafi
also appeals to our nations.

00:08:55.120 --> 00:08:59.200
In July of 2009, the G eight
summit was held in Italy

00:08:59.200 --> 00:09:02.240
with Libya invited as a guest nation.

00:09:02.240 --> 00:09:05.120
And while the other countries
were discussing major issues

00:09:05.120 --> 00:09:06.400
like climate change

00:09:06.400 --> 00:09:08.960
and energy policy, Gaddafi was trying

00:09:08.960 --> 00:09:10.880
to convince fellow world leaders

00:09:10.880 --> 00:09:14.640
to support his personal
vendetta against Switzerland.

00:09:14.640 --> 00:09:19.120
His proposal was extraordinary.

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:22.000
Switzerland should be dissolved entirely

00:09:22.000 --> 00:09:24.640
with the French speaking
regions handed to France,

00:09:24.640 --> 00:09:26.800
the German speaking regions to Germany

00:09:26.800 --> 00:09:29.760
and the Italian speaking ones to Italy.

00:09:29.760 --> 00:09:33.920
The idea is quietly ignored

00:09:33.920 --> 00:09:38.080
and so he submits his infamous
proposal again this time

00:09:38.080 --> 00:09:39.600
to the United Nations

00:09:39.600 --> 00:09:43.760
where it is quickly dismissed
As the UN charter prohibits

00:09:43.760 --> 00:09:47.920
nations from threatening the
existence of other countries

00:09:47.920 --> 00:09:50.880
and after achieving little
on the international stage,

00:09:50.880 --> 00:09:55.600
Gaddafi has one different idea.

00:09:55.600 --> 00:09:56.720
Up to this point,

00:09:56.720 --> 00:10:00.560
the fallout had been mere
geopolitical disruptive,

00:10:00.560 --> 00:10:03.760
sometimes costly, but abstract.

00:10:03.760 --> 00:10:06.240
But what followed now was different

00:10:06.240 --> 00:10:10.800
as two Swiss citizens completely
unrelated to the dispute,

00:10:10.800 --> 00:10:13.600
got pulled into the conflict.

00:10:13.600 --> 00:10:18.240
This is Max Gerdy and
this is Rashid Hamani.

00:10:18.240 --> 00:10:20.320
They both hold Swiss citizenship

00:10:20.320 --> 00:10:23.760
and they work for the company A, B, B.

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:27.120
Now, A BB is one of those
Swiss companies that was forced

00:10:27.120 --> 00:10:30.000
to end its operations in
Libya following the arrest

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:33.600
of Hannibal, Goldie
and Hamani are arrested

00:10:33.600 --> 00:10:36.160
and they are charged
with illegal residency

00:10:36.160 --> 00:10:38.480
and illegal economic activity.

00:10:38.480 --> 00:10:40.960
Even though when they
entered the country, none

00:10:40.960 --> 00:10:44.000
of this was in place.

00:10:44.000 --> 00:10:46.960
Just before he's taken
to prison, GDI manages

00:10:46.960 --> 00:10:49.680
to briefly call the
Swiss embassy for advice

00:10:49.680 --> 00:10:52.720
because he knows he hasn't
committed any crime,

00:10:52.720 --> 00:10:56.240
but there is little any
ambassador can do for the two men.

00:10:56.240 --> 00:10:59.280
The Libyan officers are
officials of the government

00:10:59.280 --> 00:11:01.120
and there is no grounds for GDI

00:11:01.120 --> 00:11:04.320
and Hamani to resist being arrested.

00:11:04.320 --> 00:11:07.840
And so the two men are taken
to prison where they are held

00:11:07.840 --> 00:11:11.360
with no idea what is coming next.

00:11:11.360 --> 00:11:14.000
After 10 days with no
additional information,

00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:16.480
they are finally allowed out on bail,

00:11:16.480 --> 00:11:18.880
but the condition of
their bail prohibit them

00:11:18.880 --> 00:11:20.400
from leaving the country.

00:11:20.400 --> 00:11:22.800
Their passports are confiscated

00:11:22.800 --> 00:11:25.280
and they remain stuck in Libya while their

00:11:25.280 --> 00:11:27.360
charges are pending.

00:11:27.360 --> 00:11:30.880
Meanwhile, back in Switzerland,
Swiss authorities are aware

00:11:30.880 --> 00:11:32.160
of the arrested men

00:11:32.160 --> 00:11:35.920
and begin work immediately
to bring them back home.

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:39.120
Ambassadors try negotiating
with Libian officials,

00:11:39.120 --> 00:11:41.680
but they make little progress also

00:11:41.680 --> 00:11:45.360
because Gaddafi denies that
these arrests are in retaliation

00:11:45.360 --> 00:11:47.680
for his son being arrested.

00:11:47.680 --> 00:11:51.200
And with diplomacy failing
Swiss authorities begin to turn

00:11:51.200 --> 00:11:55.760
to an extraordinary new
approach using special forces

00:11:55.760 --> 00:11:59.600
to smuggle the two men out of Libya.

00:11:59.600 --> 00:12:03.600
And the plan is to go like this.

00:12:03.600 --> 00:12:06.480
South of the city of
Chipotle, there is a compound

00:12:06.480 --> 00:12:08.000
of buildings that belongs

00:12:08.000 --> 00:12:11.520
to the Swedish telecommunications
company, Ericsson.

00:12:11.520 --> 00:12:15.280
And on their property there is
a large swimming pool as well

00:12:15.280 --> 00:12:17.280
as a tennis court.

00:12:17.280 --> 00:12:22.880
The plan is that girlie and
Hamani will visit that building.

00:12:22.880 --> 00:12:25.600
Their cover will be that
they are simply going there

00:12:25.600 --> 00:12:28.240
to relax and use the pool.

00:12:28.240 --> 00:12:30.560
And so the men make it a habit

00:12:30.560 --> 00:12:34.080
to frequently drive from the
Swiss embassy all the way to

00:12:34.080 --> 00:12:37.280
that swimming pool compound,
spend the day there

00:12:37.280 --> 00:12:40.080
and then head back to the embassy.

00:12:40.080 --> 00:12:43.360
This way the Libyan officials
secretly shadowing them will

00:12:43.360 --> 00:12:45.280
become used to that movement

00:12:45.280 --> 00:12:48.400
and hopefully they will
pay less attention.

00:12:48.400 --> 00:12:51.920
Now the plan is that on one
random day, instead of heading

00:12:51.920 --> 00:12:54.640
to the pool, there will be
a driver waiting for them

00:12:54.640 --> 00:12:57.920
so they can secretly
sneak into an escape car

00:12:57.920 --> 00:13:00.560
and this car will then take
them through the desert

00:13:00.560 --> 00:13:04.400
and across the border leaving the country.

00:13:04.400 --> 00:13:07.440
But this plan has its weaknesses for one,

00:13:07.440 --> 00:13:09.920
even if they make it to Egypt, Algeria

00:13:09.920 --> 00:13:13.520
or Tunisia, all those countries
at the time had good ties

00:13:13.520 --> 00:13:15.360
with Libya and were very likely

00:13:15.360 --> 00:13:18.080
to simply send the men straight back.

00:13:18.080 --> 00:13:21.280
And so eventually the plan gets scrapped,

00:13:21.280 --> 00:13:24.400
but a new plan is drawn
up by Swiss intelligence,

00:13:24.400 --> 00:13:27.920
this one even more adventurous.

00:13:27.920 --> 00:13:30.400
Instead of going to a
swimming pool, girlie

00:13:30.400 --> 00:13:34.160
and hamani would be
provided with jet skis.

00:13:34.160 --> 00:13:37.440
Then in the middle of the night
they could head to the beach

00:13:37.440 --> 00:13:41.520
and take their jet skis out
to the Mediterranean sea.

00:13:41.520 --> 00:13:43.120
Once they are out on the water,

00:13:43.120 --> 00:13:45.760
they would just keep
going towards the horizon

00:13:45.760 --> 00:13:48.720
for exactly 12 nautical miles

00:13:48.720 --> 00:13:52.720
because at 12 nautical miles
the territorial waters of Libya

00:13:52.720 --> 00:13:56.960
and here special forces with
boats will be waiting for them

00:13:56.960 --> 00:13:59.200
and pick them up off the jet skis.

00:13:59.200 --> 00:14:06.400
From here on, they can
safely head towards Italy.

00:14:06.400 --> 00:14:09.840
But as fascinating as all of
these escape plans are, none

00:14:09.840 --> 00:14:13.040
of them ever receives the
green light most likely

00:14:13.040 --> 00:14:15.360
