00:14:15.360 --> 00:14:18.680
And instead, Swiss authorities
once again turn to diplomacy.

00:14:18.680 --> 00:14:22.320
We opening negotiations with the dictator.

00:14:22.320 --> 00:14:25.280
By this point, it had been
over a year since Hamani

00:14:25.280 --> 00:14:29.440
and GDI were arrested, and
in an unprecedented move,

00:14:29.440 --> 00:14:33.520
the president of Switzerland,
Hans Mads, decides to travel

00:14:33.520 --> 00:14:36.880
to Tripoli himself in order
to broker their release

00:14:36.880 --> 00:14:40.800
and restore normal relations
between the two countries.

00:14:40.800 --> 00:14:42.320
Mez knows that bowing

00:14:42.320 --> 00:14:44.800
