of the dictator's son was unnecessary

00:15:05.200 --> 00:15:06.560
and the Swiss president decides

00:15:06.560 --> 00:15:08.720
to go even another stepfather.

00:15:08.720 --> 00:15:12.160
Madz knows that Gaddafi wants
the names of the officers

00:15:12.160 --> 00:15:14.320
