an independent tribunal

00:15:21.920 --> 00:15:24.400
that will investigate if Hannibal was

00:15:24.400 --> 00:15:26.720
mistreated during his arrest.

00:15:26.720 --> 00:15:30.160
And it is starting to
look better as in return

00:15:30.160 --> 00:15:31.360
to these concessions.

00:15:31.360 --> 00:15:33.920
The Libyan Prime Minister
promises that GDI

00:15:33.920 --> 00:15:35.600
and Hamani will be allowed

00:15:35.600 --> 00:15:39.360
to leave Libya within a few weeks.

00:15:40.560 --> 00:15:42.800
It is the best that Merz seems to be able

00:15:42.800 --> 00:15:45.120
to get from the Libyan officials.

00:15:45.120 --> 00:15:48.720
And so he returns home
though instead of applause

00:15:48.720 --> 00:15:52.480
for arranging the hostages
release, he returns to scorn

00:15:52.480 --> 00:15:55.440
and criticism over the
apology with many claiming

00:15:55.440 --> 00:15:57.920
