00:15:57.920 --> 00:16:01.200
And those that are doubting
seem to have a point,

00:16:01.200 --> 00:16:04.480
especially once a new wrinkle
appears in the already

00:16:04.480 --> 00:16:08.720
troubled Swiss Libyan relations

00:16:08.720 --> 00:16:10.080
Tribune De Janene,

00:16:10.080 --> 00:16:14.000
a newspaper based in Geneva
leaks the mugshot that was taken

00:16:14.000 --> 00:16:17.840
of Hannibal Gaddafi after his arrest.

00:16:17.840 --> 00:16:21.360
This is a new step of
humiliation for Hannibal

00:16:21.360 --> 00:16:24.320
and the Gaddafi family as a whole.

00:16:24.320 --> 00:16:28.000
The Gaddafi's immediately
file a civil suit against a

00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:29.920
newspaper seeking the equivalent

00:16:29.920 --> 00:16:33.280
of 90,000 US dollars in damages.

00:16:33.280 --> 00:16:35.360
And a Swiss court does rule

00:16:35.360 --> 00:16:39.520
that ALT's privacy was indeed
violated by the leaked photos,

00:16:39.520 --> 00:16:41.840
but it denies awarding the Gaddafi any

00:16:41.840 --> 00:16:44.320
