00:16:44.320 --> 00:16:46.000
But if the arrest of GDI

00:16:46.000 --> 00:16:48.400
and Hamani is not retaliation

00:16:48.400 --> 00:16:50.800
for Hannibal's ongoing situation,

00:16:50.800 --> 00:16:54.080
this new development should
not affect the upcoming

00:16:54.080 --> 00:16:56.480
release of the two men.

00:16:56.480 --> 00:16:58.000
And at first it does seem

00:16:58.000 --> 00:17:01.600
that everything is still
on track just three days

00:17:01.600 --> 00:17:04.720
before they are to board a
plane for Switzerland, GDI

00:17:04.720 --> 00:17:08.640
and Hamani are sent to a liven
