00:17:08.640 --> 00:17:11.440
to make sure they are in good health.

00:17:11.440 --> 00:17:13.520
But once they go into the hospital,

00:17:13.520 --> 00:17:15.760
they never come back out.

00:17:15.760 --> 00:17:21.440
Gdi and Hamani have simply vanished,

00:17:21.440 --> 00:17:24.720
fearing the worst Swiss diplomats
