00:17:24.720 --> 00:17:29.360
for the two men not knowing
if they are even still alive.

00:17:30.560 --> 00:17:32.640
Weeks pass.

00:17:32.640 --> 00:17:35.520
And Libyan officials
eventually declared that Goldie

00:17:35.520 --> 00:17:40.400
and Hamdani are held at a
secure location, secure from

00:17:40.400 --> 00:17:42.640
what Swiss officials don't know,

00:17:42.640 --> 00:17:44.720
but at least it seems to be confirmation

00:17:44.720 --> 00:17:47.360
that the men are still alive

00:17:47.360 --> 00:17:51.200
and is at this point when
the strategy seems to change.

00:17:51.200 --> 00:17:53.360
Instead of causing up to the Gaddafi

00:17:53.360 --> 00:17:56.640
and trying to find some
compromise in negotiations,

00:17:56.640 --> 00:17:57.600
Switzerland decides

00:17:57.600 --> 00:18:00.160
to put pressure on
Libyan officials in a way

00:18:00.160 --> 00:18:02.320
that they know will hurt.

00:18:02.320 --> 00:18:06.320
They begin to deny issuing
visas to top Libyan officials

00:18:06.320 --> 00:18:10.880
for Chenin zone, including
to the Gaddafi family

00:18:10.880 --> 00:18:12.720
as part of the Sheen agreement.

00:18:12.720 --> 00:18:14.240
If one country that is part

00:18:14.240 --> 00:18:17.920
of this agreement has blacklisted
anyone from entering all

00:18:17.920 --> 00:18:20.000
countries must comply.

00:18:20.000 --> 00:18:24.080
And this effectively bars the
entire Gaddafi family from

00:18:24.080 --> 00:18:27.840
entering nearly all of Europe.

00:18:27.840 --> 00:18:31.120
Just days after this
announcement, out of nowhere,

00:18:31.120 --> 00:18:34.240
a car pulls up to the
Swiss embassy in Tripoli

00:18:34.240 --> 00:18:36.560
and out tumble non-ED and Girly

00:18:36.560 --> 00:18:39.920
and Hamani released from
wherever they were held

00:18:39.920 --> 00:18:41.680
for seven weeks.

00:18:41.680 --> 00:18:44.400
Though Libyan officials had
denied they were being held

00:18:44.400 --> 00:18:46.400
captive, the men would later report

00:18:46.400 --> 00:18:49.600
that they had been held in
solitary confinement in prison

00:18:49.600 --> 00:18:51.440
cells with no information

00:18:51.440 --> 00:18:54.880
