00:20:23.680 --> 00:20:26.880
Goldie and Hamani refused to
leave the embassy to report

00:20:26.880 --> 00:20:28.960
to prison, and their lawyers work

00:20:28.960 --> 00:20:30.800
to appeal their conviction.

00:20:30.800 --> 00:20:34.000
And amazingly it works to a degree.

00:20:34.000 --> 00:20:37.760
Hamani has his sentence
